name: cis-windows-security-options-retract
description: Retraction module for cis-windows-security-options. Removes all resources installed by the cis-windows-security-options module. Review before activating.

resources:
  # windows_defender: defender-behavior-monitoring — manual cleanup required

  # windows_defender: defender-realtime-protection — manual cleanup required

  # registry: smb-signing-required — remove or restore default registry value manually

  # registry: interactive-logon-message-text — remove or restore default registry value manually

  # registry: interactive-logon-message-title — remove or restore default registry value manually

  # local_security_policy: disable-guest-account — restore default policy value manually
